---
interface Props {
  lang: 'en' | 'zh';
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';
const presets = [0, 30, 59, 60, 90, 120];
---
<section id="aegis-clock" class="aegis-clock" data-aegis-demo data-locale={lang}>
  <p class="kicker">{zh ? '可调时钟' : 'Adjustable clock'}</p>
  <h2 class="aegis-clock-title">
    {zh ? '同一密钥，时间块一变，验证码就变' : 'Same key, next time block, next code'}
  </h2>
  <p class="aegis-clock-note">
    {
      zh
        ? '密钥是 RFC 6238 的公开测试串，不是任何账户种子。演示按发行版 APK 里还原出的规则计算：30 秒一块、HMAC-SHA1、默认六位。'
        : 'The key is the public RFC 6238 test string, not an account seed. The demo runs the rule recovered from the release APK: 30-second blocks, HMAC-SHA1, six digits by default.'
    }
  </p>
  <label class="aegis-clock-slider">
    <span>
      {zh ? '示例时间' : 'Example time'}
      {' '}
      <strong data-aegis-seconds>59</strong>
      {zh ? ' 秒' : ' seconds'}
    </span>
    <input type="range" min="0" max="120" value="59" step="1" disabled aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="120" aria-valuenow="59" />
  </label>
  <div class="aegis-clock-presets">
    {presets.map((n) => (
      <button type="button" data-aegis-time={String(n)} disabled>{n}</button>
    ))}
  </div>
  <ol class="aegis-clock-steps">
    <li>
      <span>01</span>
      <p>{zh ? '时间' : 'Time'}</p>
      <strong><span data-aegis-seconds>59</span> {zh ? '秒' : 's'}</strong>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>02</span>
      <p>{zh ? '30 秒时间块' : '30-second block'}</p>
      <strong data-aegis-block>1</strong>
      <code data-aegis-division>floor(59 / 30)</code>
      <small data-aegis-window>{zh ? '30–59 秒' : '30–59 seconds'}</small>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>03</span>
      <p>{zh ? '六位验证码' : 'Six-digit code'}</p>
      <strong class="aegis-code" data-aegis-code>287082</strong>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="aegis-clock-status" data-aegis-status>
    {zh ? '未启用 JavaScript 时，图中是 59 秒的结果。' : 'Without JavaScript, the figure shows the result at 59 seconds.'}
  </p>
  <div class="aegis-clock-check">
    <button type="button" data-aegis-check disabled>
      {zh ? '用 RFC 6238 向量核对' : 'Check against RFC 6238 vectors'}
    </button>
    <p data-aegis-check-result></p>
  </div>
</section>
<script is:inline type="module" src="/scripts/showcase/aegis-demo.js"></script>
